<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Sagami Bay Convoy Raid, 2022</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Sagami Bay Convoy Raid, 2022&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Al "Beirutdude" Sandrik&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;The Time Is: 29 April, 2022, 21:00 Zulu/30 April 2022, 06:00 Tokyo Time&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Sagami Bay, Japan&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable as PLANS Changzheng 19 (SSN-419) Only&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;24 Hours Duration&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Built under C:MO v1.02 &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT face="Courier New"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Courier New"&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;– Build 1147.21&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Database: DB3000 v488&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;(This is an extension of the "Ryukyu Islands, 2022" and &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P align=center&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;"To Kill the Queen, 2022" Scenarios)&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Background:&lt;/STRONG&gt; The war has been going on for almost a month. On 19 April 2022, taking advantage of the situation, the DPRK crossed the DMZ and is heavily shelling Seoul. NKPA advances are limited to within 20 to 25 km of the DMZ in the center and west of the peninsula but ROK supplies are running low. A convoy is forming near Tokyo, in Sagami Bay, and is waiting for its escorts. The JMSDF are guarding the entrances to the bay and the heavily attrited H-6s are needed elsewhere. Only your Changzheng 19 (SSN-419) nuclear attack submarine is available, but your command represents the newest and most advanced PLAN Submarine in existence. You must destroy as many of the convoy vessels as possible and escape.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;To help you in your mission a PLA cyber-attack has brought down the Sagami Bay SOSUS Station; however, that is just temporary as JMSDF technicians work feverously to bring it back online.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Mission:&lt;/STRONG&gt; Penetrate the JMSDF defenses/patrols and sink as many of the convoy vessels as possible. It is also possible that one or two USN escort vessels may have arrived on scene. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Notes&lt;/STRONG&gt;: There is heavy shipping still entering Tokyo Bay, not as much as before the war (check out the AIS Marine Tracker for this area) but still enough to cause major ambient noise. Also, the weather is heavy rainfall with moderate seas, which should also provide you with cover. &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;Your chances of surviving are not good! 　&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;You must run the scenario for 10 seconds to allow units (and missions) to teleport.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Scoring:&lt;/STRONG&gt; 0 points = Disaster and 6,000 a Triumph. Each convoy vessel is worth 1,000 VPs but no other merchant vessels are worth any points. The convoy is anchored in Sagami Bay in a square outside the shipping lanes. Other vessels are anchored around the area, waiting to enter Tokyo Bay, so be sure you are attacking the convoy itself! &lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Originally built under&amp;nbsp;under C:MO v1.02 Build 1147.11 Database: DB3000 v487&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;Rebuilt on 4/25/2021 to v1.02 Build 1147.21 Database: DB300 v488&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Both an .INI and Delta File are provided for deep rebuilds.&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Al "BeirutDude" Sandrik (ex-Beachinnole)&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT face="Times New Roman"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Al.Sandrik@gmail.com&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
